[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    57[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | C4  | `driver` | `x` randomized in `100..=999` — 3-digit `i`, `j` reaches 4 digits | [x] |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    58[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | C5  | `driver` | `x` randomized in `1_000..=9_999` — 4-digit `i`, `j` reaches 5 digits | [x] |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    59[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | C6  | `driver` | `x` randomized in `10_000..=99_999` — 5-digit `i`, `j` reaches 6 digits | [x] |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    60[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | C7  | `driver` | `x` randomized in `100_000..=999_999` — 6-digit `i`, `j` reaches 7 digits | [x] |
