[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    66[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | C13 | `driver` | `x = i32::MAX` used only as the loop bound *comparison* path (see C9 for full run); `x = i32::MAX` vs `x = i32::MAX - 1` produce the same prefix — verified via 1-line-per-flush prefix comparison over the first 1 M lines | [x] |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    67[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | C14 | `driver` | repeated invocation: same `x` called 50× in a row on the same loaded handle — asserts no residual state accumulates in either library | [x] |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    68[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | C15 | `driver` | interleaved invocation: `C(x1) → Rust(x1) → C(x2) → Rust(x2) → …` over 200 randomized `x`, all sharing the one process-wide libc `stdout` — asserts the shared `FILE*` is left in the same state by both | [x] |
