[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    72[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    73[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Binary executable
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    74[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    75[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `c_src/CMakeLists.txt` declares only `add_library(driver SHARED src/driver.c)`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    76[0m:[38;5;10m[49m and installs headers/lib. There is **no** `add_executable`, and
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    77[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `translation/Cargo.toml` declares only `crate-type = ["cdylib"]` with no
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    78[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `[[bin]]`. The "compare C and Rust binary stdout" requirement is therefore
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    79[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **not applicable** — there is no driver binary in either tree.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    80[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    81[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Feature combinations
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    82[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    83[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `translation/Cargo.toml` has **no** `[features]` section and no optional
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    84[0m:[38;5;10m[49m dependencies, so the complete set of feature combinations is the single default
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    85[0m:[38;5;10m[49m one. Verified mechanically by `tests/../check_features.sh`, which parses
